      "index": "b6T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 428294830,
      "version": 808,
      "versionNonce": 37154152,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "DP48LbXo_iA6D7LOyrnCh",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "SfDwayTY_ryCe1OVlamZV",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1788367735934,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Document Editor Service\n\n- Removes duplicate operations using (site identifier,\nsequence number)\n- Appends to Kafka first (key = document identifier,\nacknowledgements = all), publis to\ndocument.operations which returns the revision\nnumber\n\n- Applies the operation to the Redis hot CRDT state\n(no time to live)\n\n- Fans out the operation: local sockets first, then\nRedis publish/subscribe\n  to the other pods\n- Acknowledges {sequence number, revision number}\nlast, and only then the  client clears its IndexedDB\nbuffer",
      "fontSize": 14.278332626286756,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Document Editor Service\n\n- Removes duplicate operations using (site identifier, sequence number)\n- Appends to Kafka first (key = document identifier, acknowledgements = all), publis to document.operations which returns the revision number\n\n- Applies the operation to the Redis hot CRDT state (no time to live)\n\n- Fans out the operation: local sockets first, then Redis publish/subscribe\n  to the other pods\n- Acknowledges {sequence number, revision number} last, and only then the  client clears its IndexedDB buffer",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
